      "amount": "2 tablespoons",
      "notes": "for cooking"
    },
    {
      "name": "White Wine (optional)",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "for added flavor"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large saucepan, heat olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add mussels and cook until they start to open (about 3-4 minutes).",
    "Add pilaf, Russian pilaf seasoning, and warming spices. Stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish.",
    "If using white wine, pour it over the mussels.",
    "Top with crispy onions (if using).",
    "Cover the dish with foil and bake for 15 minutes.",
    "Remove the foil and continue baking for an additional 5-7 minutes, or until mussels are cooked through.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional crispy onions if desired."
